# The pointer theme of the system (docs/POINTERS.md, section 5), under the
# license of the repository. Each shape is an outline: closed contours of
# lines and quadratic curves in layers. A contour of a layer "fill" or of an
# accent is the whole shape: the tool draws an edge of 1 pixel inside it at
# every size, then the fill. The theme file holds two forms: a white fill in
# a dark edge for a dark desktop, a dark fill in a white edge for a light one.
#
# A unit is a pixel at the size 24: an integer coordinate is a pixel corner,
# so each level and upright edge is sharp at 24 and at 48. A stroke is 3
# units wide: 1 pixel of fill between two pixels of edge at 24. Two contours
# of one layer that must join overlap by 2 units; two fingers overlap by 1,
# so that 1 pixel of edge parts them at 24, and a line of edge of half a
# unit parts them at 48. The option "hot" is the pixel that points, at 24.
# The centre of a symmetric shape is the pixel 11.
theme System
license MIT
attribution The pointer theme of the system, drawn as outlines in resources/pointers/system.manifest.

sizes 24 48

# A slanted arrow with a narrow tail; the side from the point to the wing is
# steeper than 45 degrees.
shape arrow hot 1 1
layer fill
contour 1 1 line 1 17 line 5 13 line 7.89 19.5 line 10.63 18.28 line 8.28 13 line 11 13

# An I-beam: a stem of 1 pixel, two small bars.
shape text hot 11 11
layer fill
contour 8 3 line 15 3 line 15 6 line 8 6
contour 8 17 line 15 17 line 15 20 line 8 20
contour 10 4 line 13 4 line 13 19 line 10 19

# A hand: the index finger up, three fingers folded, the thumb at the left.
shape pointing_hand hot 7 1
layer fill
contour 6 14 line 6 3 curve 6 1 8 1 curve 10 1 10 3 line 10 14
contour 9 14 line 9 9 curve 9 7 11 7 curve 13 7 13 9 line 13 14
contour 12 14 line 12 10 curve 12 8 14 8 curve 16 8 16 10 line 16 14
contour 15 15 line 15 11.5 curve 15 10 16.5 10 curve 18 10 18 11.5 line 18 15
contour 6 12 line 18 12 line 18 17 curve 18 20 15 20 line 9 20 curve 6 20 6 17
contour 8 12 line 5 12 curve 3 12 3 14 curve 3 16 5 16 line 8 16
layer edge
contour 9.5 8 line 10 8 line 10 13 line 9.5 13
contour 12.5 9 line 13 9 line 13 13 line 12.5 13
contour 15.5 11 line 16 11 line 16 13 line 15.5 13

# Four arrows from the centre, with shafts of 1 pixel.
