contour 4 10 line 19 10 line 19 13 line 4 13
contour 11.5 1.5 line 16 6 line 7 6
contour 11.5 21.5 line 7 17 line 16 17
contour 1.5 11.5 line 6 7 line 6 16
contour 21.5 11.5 line 17 16 line 17 7

# An open hand: four fingers up, the thumb at the left.
