contour 8 13 line 8 5 curve 8 3 10 3 curve 12 3 12 5 line 12 13
contour 11 13 line 11 6 curve 11 4 13 4 curve 15 4 15 6 line 15 13
contour 14 13 line 14 8 curve 14 6 16 6 curve 18 6 18 8 line 18 13
contour 5 11 line 18 11 line 18 17 curve 18 20 15 20 line 8 20 curve 5 20 5 17
contour 7 12 line 4 12 curve 2 12 2 14 curve 2 16 4 16 line 7 16
layer edge
contour 8.5 6 line 9 6 line 9 12 line 8.5 12
contour 11.5 5 line 12 5 line 12 12 line 11.5 12
contour 14.5 7 line 15 7 line 15 12 line 14.5 12

# A closed hand: four knuckles on the palm, the thumb at the left.
shape grabbing hot 11 13
layer fill
contour 5 13 line 5 10 curve 5 8 7 8 curve 9 8 9 10 line 9 13
contour 8 13 line 8 9 curve 8 7 10 7 curve 12 7 12 9 line 12 13
contour 11 13 line 11 9 curve 11 7 13 7 curve 15 7 15 9 line 15 13
contour 14 13 line 14 10 curve 14 8 16 8 curve 18 8 18 10 line 18 13
contour 5 10 line 18 10 line 18 17 curve 18 20 15 20 line 8 20 curve 5 20 5 17
contour 7 12 line 4 12 curve 2 12 2 14 curve 2 16 4 16 line 7 16
layer edge
contour 8.5 9 line 9 9 line 9 11 line 8.5 11
contour 11.5 8 line 12 8 line 12 11 line 11.5 11
contour 14.5 9 line 15 9 line 15 11 line 14.5 11

# A thin ring. In each frame a dot in the blue of the focus is one eighth of
# a turn further, clockwise: one turn in one second.
shape wait hot 11 11
layer fill
circle 11.5 11.5 8.5
layer clear
circle 11.5 11.5 5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 11.5 4.75 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 16.273 6.727 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 18.25 11.5 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 16.273 16.273 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 11.5 18.25 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 6.727 16.273 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 4.75 11.5 1.5
frame 125
layer accent title inside
circle 6.727 6.727 1.5

