# A thin ring, and a slash in the red of "stop a program" from the upper
# left to the lower right; the ends of the slash reach the edge of the ring.
shape forbidden hot 11 11
layer fill
circle 11.5 11.5 8.5
layer clear
circle 11.5 11.5 5.5
layer accent stop_program
contour 16.804 14.682 line 14.682 16.804 line 6.196 8.318 line 8.318 6.196

# The arrow, and a question mark in the blue of the focus at its right.
shape help hot 1 1
layer fill
contour 1 1 line 1 17 line 5 13 line 7.89 19.5 line 10.63 18.28 line 8.28 13 line 11 13
layer accent title
contour 14.5 14 curve 14.5 10 18.5 10 curve 22.5 10 22.5 14 curve 22.5 16.5 20 17 line 20 20 line 17 20 line 17 16 curve 19.5 15.5 19.5 14 curve 19.5 13 18.5 13 curve 17.5 13 17.5 14
contour 17 21 line 20 21 line 20 24 line 17 24

# Four arms of 1 pixel, and a dot in the amber of a match at the hot spot.
