layer fill
contour 10 1 line 13 1 line 13 8 line 10 8
contour 10 15 line 13 15 line 13 22 line 10 22
contour 1 10 line 8 10 line 8 13 line 1 13
contour 15 10 line 22 10 line 22 13 line 15 13
layer accent boot_program
circle 11.5 11.5 2

