layer fill
contour 10 4 line 13 4 line 13 19 line 10 19
contour 11.5 1.5 line 16 6 line 7 6
contour 11.5 21.5 line 7 17 line 16 17

# The two diagonal arrows: heads with a level and an upright side, so that
# these two sides stay sharp, and a shaft of 3 units across. Their centre is
# the corner 12,12.
shape resize_top_left_bottom_right hot 11 11
layer fill
contour 3 3 line 10 3 line 3 10
contour 21 21 line 14 21 line 21 14
contour 5.25 3.75 line 20.25 18.75 line 18.75 20.25 line 3.75 5.25

shape resize_top_right_bottom_left hot 12 11
layer fill
contour 21 3 line 21 10 line 14 3
contour 3 21 line 3 14 line 10 21
contour 18.75 3.75 line 20.25 5.25 line 5.25 20.25 line 3.75 18.75
